          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Costco is one of the cheapest places to buy protein powder in the US, but only for the handful of products it stocks. Kirkland Signature Whey is the value pick, Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard is the low-risk name brand, and Ascent is the certified choice. Isolates and Orgain solve specific problems at a higher cost per gram.
